{"product_id":"bleach-3-in-1-edition-vol-22-includes-vols-64-65-66-22","title":"Bleach (3-in-1 Edition), Vol. 22: Includes vols. 64, 65 \u0026 66 (22)","description":"\u003cp\u003ePart-time student, full-time Soul Reaper, Ichigo is one of the chosen few guardians of the afterlife.Ichigo Kurosaki never asked for the ability to see ghosts—he was born with the gift. When his family is attacked by a Hollow—a malevolent lost soul—Ichigo becomes a Soul Reaper, dedicating his life to protecting the innocent and helping the tortured spirits themselves find peace. Find out why Tite Kubo’s Bleach has become an international manga smash-hit!The Quincy invasion of the Soul Society continues, and it seems like there is nothing the Court Guards can do to stop it! Yhwach and his special Stern Ritter troops have bizarre and frightening powers that threaten to defeat even the strongest of the captains. Is this the Soul Reapers’ last stand?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 191\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Tite Kubo\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781421596044\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 592\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45434483605657,"sku":"Manga-A-4-9781421596044","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6839e4f9936e0_Bleach__3-in-1_Edition__Vol._22_Includes_vols._64__65___66__22.jpg?v=1748708387","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/bleach-3-in-1-edition-vol-22-includes-vols-64-65-66-22","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}